# Density Compare
# Seaborgium (Sg) — real density 35 g/cm³. equal masses: Seaborgium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Seaborgium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 6.1mm color: #80a0ff at (-20mm, 3.1mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 279.2 g — the water cube is the reference
